{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年35歲的2013年港姐冠軍陳凱琳（Grace），與視帝鄭嘉穎結婚後「四年抱三」，育有三名可愛兒子。</p><p>雖然專注家庭，但陳凱琳並未放棄個人事業，近年積極轉型為吸金力強的人氣KOL，同時打理自家朱古力生意。</p><p>今年初她更北上參與綜藝《乘風2026》</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.221102+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.748961+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.748961+00:00","content_hash":"1a6e7ec9ec4c310d62611f7ec2f7d3b579915923263dee25f9252e37aa424fbe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}